WEBVTT

00:00:00.293 --> 00:00:07.463
The barn princess.

00:00:13.487 --> 00:00:19.631
Candy's heart was overwhelmed with
happiness on her first party.

00:00:19.666 --> 00:00:23.801
She was even able to dance with
Anthony, whom she likes very much.

00:00:24.572 --> 00:00:30.692
But then, Neil and Eliza tried
to abduct Candy.

00:00:31.086 --> 00:00:34.419
To bring a servant to a party...

00:00:34.454 --> 00:00:37.562
Madam Leagan is such a gentle person.

00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:42.559
Even though everybody was saying that,
deep inside they were condemning the idea.

00:01:07.613 --> 00:01:10.960
...and it was such a wonderful party.

00:01:12.199 --> 00:01:17.455
I'm so sorry that I can't show you
just how beautiful my party dress was.

00:01:19.848 --> 00:01:22.774
At least, I can show you this drawing.

00:01:24.565 --> 00:01:28.250
-It's so pretty.
-She looks like a princess!

00:01:28.465 --> 00:01:30.715
I want to see the real one!

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.967
That's right. I'm sure you'll
see it one day.

00:01:33.457 --> 00:01:37.286
Candy really became a princess
in the Leagan family.

00:01:37.321 --> 00:01:38.561
Yes.

00:01:41.819 --> 00:01:45.672
Candy, you are not a part
of the Leagan family!

00:01:47.262 --> 00:01:48.085
I understand.

00:01:48.120 --> 00:01:51.140
If you understand, what were
you doing at the party?

00:01:51.207 --> 00:01:54.381
You were snobbish as if you
were one of us!

00:01:54.461 --> 00:01:57.198
Uh, I was just trying to be
my usual self...

00:01:57.544 --> 00:02:01.590
And then you go around
stealing boys from other people!

00:02:06.796 --> 00:02:08.212
My bed!

00:02:08.732 --> 00:02:11.538
Candy, from today, you'll be
changing your room!

00:02:11.777 --> 00:02:13.042
Changing...?

00:02:16.946 --> 00:02:19.622
You want me to sleep in the garden?

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:23.150
In the barn.

00:02:23.185 --> 00:02:24.366
In the barn?

00:02:27.035 --> 00:02:29.958
Candy, that place suits you perfectly!

00:02:31.444 --> 00:02:35.478
It's a wonderful place for your
head to cool off!

00:02:37.081 --> 00:02:43.792
When he finds out that you're living
in the barn, Anthony will stop seeing you.

00:02:43.912 --> 00:02:47.750
I'm leaving now.
Stewart, prepare the car!

00:02:50.738 --> 00:02:52.736
At least, try to get along
with the horses.

00:03:03.053 --> 00:03:06.748
Anthony... he's not such a person.

00:03:26.919 --> 00:03:29.756
They threw me out from the
attic and into the barn...?

00:03:35.951 --> 00:03:41.715
I thought that it would be
much worse... let's get along!

00:03:45.233 --> 00:03:48.897
You guys thought that since I'm
here now, you would have to go?

00:03:49.291 --> 00:03:52.927
Don't worry, I'll be your friend.

00:03:57.053 --> 00:03:58.767
Kurin, what happened?

00:04:00.799 --> 00:04:02.429
What are you saying?

00:04:12.207 --> 00:04:13.547
Anthony!

00:04:16.384 --> 00:04:17.597
Kurin!

00:04:18.079 --> 00:04:19.806
Hey, Candy!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:23.548
Uh...

00:04:24.133 --> 00:04:26.492
Eliza and Neal have gone out...

00:04:26.527 --> 00:04:29.273
That's exactly why I came.
Because both of them are gone.

00:04:33.361 --> 00:04:36.610
I thought you'd be going
out with them.

00:04:37.598 --> 00:04:39.048
Uh, I...

00:04:39.191 --> 00:04:43.105
That's right. They are not being
nice to you, both of them.

00:04:44.258 --> 00:04:46.916
Mr. Anthony, these are all.

00:04:47.112 --> 00:04:48.837
So many?

00:04:48.838 --> 00:04:51.021
I'll help you carry them.

00:04:51.233 --> 00:04:52.271
You?

00:04:52.306 --> 00:04:54.089
I'm strong enough!

00:04:57.306 --> 00:04:58.942
Are you okay, Candy?

00:05:03.746 --> 00:05:05.489
Uh-huh.

00:05:05.624 --> 00:05:08.562
Candy, carry them towards the gate.

00:05:08.597 --> 00:05:12.119
Uh, it wasn't my intention
to go this way...

00:05:14.978 --> 00:05:16.520
Candy, are you okay?

00:05:16.936 --> 00:05:18.693
I'm sorry.

00:05:19.876 --> 00:05:21.348
Are you hurt?

00:05:26.957 --> 00:05:29.253
They are so filthy, aren't they?

00:05:29.671 --> 00:05:32.277
I'm sorry for letting you do
all this work.

00:05:32.283 --> 00:05:33.672
I'll handle the rest.

00:05:40.602 --> 00:05:45.483
Anthony must have been startled
seeing my rough hands.

00:05:46.671 --> 00:05:52.377
When he finds out that you're living
in the barn, Anthony will stop seeing you.

00:06:12.910 --> 00:06:16.673
Move it, it's dangerous!
This car doesn't have any brakes!

00:06:17.162 --> 00:06:19.202
Stay clear!

00:06:19.695 --> 00:06:21.310
Boy, watch out!

00:06:28.102 --> 00:06:29.547
That was dangerous.

00:06:33.369 --> 00:06:34.651
Boy!

00:06:35.980 --> 00:06:40.563
What will I do now?
I ran him over with my car!

00:06:41.172 --> 00:06:42.464
He's dead.

00:06:42.721 --> 00:06:44.863
I'm so hungry...

00:06:45.272 --> 00:06:46.049
Eh?

00:06:51.504 --> 00:06:53.937
Madam was so horrible to you.

00:06:53.972 --> 00:06:57.061
Making such a sweet girl
take care of the horses.

00:06:57.589 --> 00:07:01.006
It's okay with me.
I really like animals!

00:07:01.447 --> 00:07:03.573
Huh? It's Stear's car!

00:07:09.107 --> 00:07:12.185
Hey, Candy!
I brought a guest of yours!

00:07:13.186 --> 00:07:14.232
My guest?

00:07:16.051 --> 00:07:17.100
Candy!

00:07:18.101 --> 00:07:19.058
John?

00:07:21.217 --> 00:07:22.940
John, did you come here all alone?

00:07:25.123 --> 00:07:26.700
Of course I did!

00:07:27.670 --> 00:07:29.459
Candy!

00:07:30.804 --> 00:07:34.354
Don't tell me you went
without telling sister Pony...

00:07:34.431 --> 00:07:35.773
Of course I did!

00:07:35.808 --> 00:07:36.908
What?

00:07:36.943 --> 00:07:42.326
Candy, John came here because he
wanted to see your beautiful dress.

00:07:42.757 --> 00:07:43.609
John...

00:07:43.644 --> 00:07:46.566
If I were his age, I'd never
have the courage to do such a thing.

00:07:47.562 --> 00:07:48.909
I'd get caught, probably.

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:52.089
Stear, don't praise him for
doing this!

00:07:53.281 --> 00:07:55.854
Hey, I barely managed to stop!

00:07:58.127 --> 00:08:01.717
I can't stop this car
once it starts moving!

00:08:05.741 --> 00:08:08.496
I'm sure everybody is
worried sick about you.

00:08:08.531 --> 00:08:11.097
I'll go back as soon
as I see your dress!

00:08:11.132 --> 00:08:14.343
That must be the window
of your room, right?

00:08:15.365 --> 00:08:16.614
That's not it...

00:08:17.087 --> 00:08:18.347
Can I see it?

00:08:18.382 --> 00:08:20.903
Come to the barn for a minute...

00:08:21.372 --> 00:08:25.621
I don't care about the horses!
I want to see Candy's room!

00:08:25.656 --> 00:08:26.621
John...

00:08:27.975 --> 00:08:30.295
Welcome back, miss Candy!

00:08:30.705 --> 00:08:31.876
Dorothy!

00:08:32.197 --> 00:08:36.726
Wow, you called Candy "miss"!
Wonderful!

00:08:36.761 --> 00:08:38.898
Such a sweet young
lad, isn't he?

00:08:41.136 --> 00:08:44.089
It's the first time
someone called me a lad...

00:08:44.116 --> 00:08:47.693
Welcome to our household.
Well now, this way!

00:08:47.728 --> 00:08:48.990
Dorothy...

00:08:49.025 --> 00:08:50.660
Leave this to me.

00:08:52.947 --> 00:08:56.385
Wow, is this Candy's room?

00:08:56.823 --> 00:08:58.843
Looks like it's made for a princess!

00:09:00.606 --> 00:09:03.691
I'm not sure it's okay
to go into Eliza's room...

00:09:04.053 --> 00:09:06.760
She won't be back before evening.

00:09:12.487 --> 00:09:14.865
John, don't open that wardrobe!

00:09:15.136 --> 00:09:16.698
Why not? It's yours!

00:09:16.763 --> 00:09:19.328
Are all of these your dresses?

00:09:19.363 --> 00:09:20.383
Yes.

00:09:20.418 --> 00:09:23.171
Candy, show me the dress which
you wore at the party!

00:09:23.206 --> 00:09:24.349
But...

00:09:25.032 --> 00:09:26.411
And in return...

00:09:28.637 --> 00:09:30.432
It's a sheet, isn't it?

00:09:30.475 --> 00:09:32.553
It's okay, just take this end!

00:09:32.992 --> 00:09:37.374
Ta-dah! Look at this, there
are no pee stains on it!

00:09:37.409 --> 00:09:40.725
Really! John, you stopped
wetting your bed!

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:42.008
That's right!

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:48.638
John, I'll show you my dress, if you came
all the way here just to show me your sheet!

00:09:49.247 --> 00:09:50.797
Okay then!

00:10:08.195 --> 00:10:10.696
Kyaa- -! Wonderful!

00:10:10.731 --> 00:10:12.178
It is, John.

00:10:14.143 --> 00:10:15.858
Don't look at me like that!

00:10:16.149 --> 00:10:20.963
I'll remember it well, and I'll tell everyone
at the Pony's home about how it looks!

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:22.637
John!

00:10:23.221 --> 00:10:27.058
-Miss!
-Move it! Why are you blocking my way?

00:10:29.761 --> 00:10:30.851
Eliza!

00:10:31.723 --> 00:10:33.455
So that's how it is.

00:10:33.986 --> 00:10:35.022
Candy?

00:10:39.108 --> 00:10:41.654
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
oops

00:10:44.847 --> 00:10:47.216
Candy, what's the meaning of this?

00:10:47.250 --> 00:10:48.833
Who is she?

00:10:48.868 --> 00:10:49.813
Eliza.

00:10:49.848 --> 00:10:51.498
Candy's sister, right?

00:10:51.533 --> 00:10:53.099
Sister?!

00:10:53.845 --> 00:10:56.264
Candy, who is this filthy runt?

00:10:56.299 --> 00:10:59.563
He's John.
Came to see me from Pony's home.

00:10:59.902 --> 00:11:02.242
He's all filthy, just what I expected!

00:11:02.277 --> 00:11:04.047
And what is this old rag
supposed to be?

00:11:04.473 --> 00:11:07.469
Dorothy! Throw it out!

00:11:09.011 --> 00:11:10.999
This is my sheet!

00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.236
You call this a sheet?

00:11:13.271 --> 00:11:16.038
Weren't you supposed to be
in the barn, Candy?

00:11:16.267 --> 00:11:17.581
What?!

00:11:17.616 --> 00:11:18.357
Stop it!

00:11:19.097 --> 00:11:25.428
Dorothy, disinfect this room immediately. Candy,
take this filthy runt to the barn where it belongs.

00:11:25.463 --> 00:11:26.306
Eliza!

00:11:26.779 --> 00:11:28.998
Mother, Candy has...

00:11:29.033 --> 00:11:31.012
Candy, you have a guest.

00:11:31.387 --> 00:11:32.315
I have...?

00:11:32.349 --> 00:11:34.542
Greet her immediately.

00:11:34.718 --> 00:11:36.511
Mother, what about the dress?

00:11:36.546 --> 00:11:38.077
Eliza, keep quiet.

00:11:40.981 --> 00:11:45.010
Candy, you look just like an adult!

00:11:45.319 --> 00:11:46.384
Sister Lane!

00:11:49.175 --> 00:11:52.168
Candy, John ran away from home.

00:11:52.530 --> 00:11:53.261
John!

00:11:54.613 --> 00:11:56.105
Good day.

00:11:56.140 --> 00:11:58.539
John! I knew I'd find you here!

00:12:01.601 --> 00:12:05.087
Mother, you'd let Candy tarnish
my room with her presence?

00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:07.161
Until those two return, yes.

00:12:07.326 --> 00:12:08.535
I don't want that!

00:12:08.796 --> 00:12:11.001
Barn is enough for Candy!

00:12:11.107 --> 00:12:16.117
Eliza, Candy left Pony's home in
order to become your playmate.

00:12:16.476 --> 00:12:19.120
If that woman finds out that
Candy is now sleeping in the barn...

00:12:19.155 --> 00:12:22.221
It's because Candy was so rude, so what?

00:12:22.256 --> 00:12:24.466
Anyway, do as I said.

00:12:24.845 --> 00:12:25.878
Mother!

00:12:25.913 --> 00:12:27.809
It's for the sake of Leagan family!

00:12:33.819 --> 00:12:37.700
I'd like both of you to be
grateful to me!

00:12:37.735 --> 00:12:41.880
John, you ran away, why do you
want us to be grateful about?

00:12:42.205 --> 00:12:44.548
That's right! Everyone was worried about you.

00:12:44.583 --> 00:12:49.275
But sister Lane kept worrying about Candy!

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:51.750
John.

00:12:52.269 --> 00:12:55.417
Candy, and you wanted to see sister Lane?

00:12:55.452 --> 00:12:58.102
Yes. I wanted to see her.

00:12:59.179 --> 00:13:02.697
I ran away from Pony's home, causing
you two to meet!

00:13:06.622 --> 00:13:07.809
Kurin!

00:13:07.844 --> 00:13:09.696
You look well too, Kurin!

00:13:13.133 --> 00:13:14.209
Kurin!

00:13:15.383 --> 00:13:18.088
Candy, is it okay for me to
play with Kurin here?

00:13:18.231 --> 00:13:19.182
Yes.

00:13:21.674 --> 00:13:23.238
Wait up, Kurin!

00:13:25.958 --> 00:13:29.389
What a huge garden! I could
get lost in here!

00:13:30.173 --> 00:13:33.995
Wait up, Kurin! I'll go back
if you disappear!

00:13:35.218 --> 00:13:37.654
What? It's a barn, isn't it?

00:13:40.338 --> 00:13:42.393
I know what horses look alike.

00:13:46.485 --> 00:13:47.843
A bed!

00:13:48.889 --> 00:13:51.305
Somebody is sleeping with the horses.

00:14:00.219 --> 00:14:02.113
Candy's pajama!

00:14:02.148 --> 00:14:04.702
Candy sleeps in such a place!?

00:14:04.902 --> 00:14:06.498
You saw it, didn't you?

00:14:06.533 --> 00:14:07.572
Candy!

00:14:07.607 --> 00:14:09.938
Aren't you a princess?

00:14:11.247 --> 00:14:12.440
I'm a princess.

00:14:12.475 --> 00:14:13.488
But then...!

00:14:13.523 --> 00:14:18.859
John, I'll be fine as long as my spirit
doesn't give in to the real princess.

00:14:19.215 --> 00:14:22.042
Candy, why weren't you telling us...

00:14:22.077 --> 00:14:24.087
John? You're a man, aren't you?

00:14:24.201 --> 00:14:26.522
Yeah, I was born as one.

00:14:26.557 --> 00:14:28.617
In that case, you can keep a secret.

00:14:28.954 --> 00:14:32.827
-You want me to lie to teachers?
-You can do it.

00:14:47.102 --> 00:14:51.237
Thanks to John, all three of us
are sleeping in the same room.

00:14:51.272 --> 00:14:53.249
He's not saying anything...

00:14:53.480 --> 00:14:55.797
Looks like he's already asleep.

00:14:56.764 --> 00:15:02.271
Candy, now I can be at peace.
I'm sure sister Pony will be glad, too.

00:15:02.484 --> 00:15:05.518
Tell her that Candy is very happy.

00:15:05.744 --> 00:15:08.010
Sister Lane, Candy is...!

00:15:08.045 --> 00:15:10.421
John, weren't you asleep?

00:15:11.240 --> 00:15:12.411
...Candy!

00:15:12.534 --> 00:15:13.898
You're a man!

00:15:14.084 --> 00:15:19.235
Since John isn't wetting his bed anymore,
he might start to oversleep regularly...

00:15:27.020 --> 00:15:31.087
Thank you for your hospitality.
Sorry for the trouble.

00:15:31.457 --> 00:15:35.991
Boy, if you want to see Candy
again, you can stop by.

00:15:36.341 --> 00:15:40.731
Don't worry about Candy.

00:15:41.484 --> 00:15:44.367
Yes, thank you very much.

00:15:45.067 --> 00:15:48.530
Please make use of my car.

00:15:48.565 --> 00:15:51.034
I couldn't accept that...!

00:15:51.831 --> 00:15:55.173
Candy, won't you come with them
till halfway?

00:15:55.208 --> 00:15:56.606
Yes.

00:16:11.784 --> 00:16:14.285
Candy!

00:16:15.645 --> 00:16:16.641
A friend?

00:16:16.676 --> 00:16:18.038
Stear and Archie.

00:16:18.424 --> 00:16:20.517
Mr. driver, please stop the car!

00:16:26.406 --> 00:16:27.733
-How do you do!
-How do you do!

00:16:28.053 --> 00:16:29.162
How do you do.

00:16:29.483 --> 00:16:34.727
The three of us, uh, though Anthony
isn't here, we'll keep an eye on Candy.

00:16:36.789 --> 00:16:40.037
I'd like to talk to Candy in
private for a moment.

00:16:40.038 --> 00:16:40.994
Okay?

00:16:41.029 --> 00:16:43.347
You're friends, why not.

00:16:52.168 --> 00:16:54.198
What did you want to talk about?

00:16:54.233 --> 00:16:57.056
Candy, don't let yourself be broken.

00:16:59.383 --> 00:17:00.918
Sister Lane.

00:17:02.763 --> 00:17:06.923
Actually, my idea was to take
you back to Pony's home.

00:17:07.701 --> 00:17:09.443
You knew, didn't you?

00:17:12.887 --> 00:17:18.237
Candy... people's mouths can lie,
but their hands don't.

00:17:18.569 --> 00:17:22.457
As soon as I saw your hands,
I knew what you've been through.

00:17:23.164 --> 00:17:24.714
Then, these hands...

00:17:27.045 --> 00:17:30.346
But... I'm not going to take you back.

00:17:30.792 --> 00:17:34.754
I now know that you have so many
friends at Leagan's household.

00:17:34.789 --> 00:17:42.035
A cook, the old gardener, and the handmaid...
There are so many people who love you.

00:17:44.279 --> 00:17:46.454
When did you see them?

00:17:46.840 --> 00:17:50.903
Oh well...
Those two, they are your friends, too?

00:17:51.318 --> 00:17:52.606
Yes.

00:17:56.766 --> 00:18:02.482
Candy, putting on a pretty dress
and living in a beautiful room...

00:18:02.517 --> 00:18:05.120
...does not amount to true happiness.

00:18:05.608 --> 00:18:12.834
True happiness is when you can turn around
and see all the warm hearts of your friends.

00:18:13.734 --> 00:18:15.867
I think that, too.

00:18:16.452 --> 00:18:23.253
Your teacher thinks that you are much
happier than Eliza.

00:18:24.363 --> 00:18:27.197
I am happy.

00:18:29.435 --> 00:18:32.182
Now your teacher can peacefully
return to Pony's home!

00:18:39.242 --> 00:18:41.110
Hang in there, Candy!

00:18:41.145 --> 00:18:44.274
If they're mean to you,
I'll keep coming all the time!

00:18:44.309 --> 00:18:47.721
The three of us will watch over
Candy, so she'll be okay.

00:18:48.145 --> 00:18:49.100
Thank you!

00:18:49.135 --> 00:18:51.139
John, come to see me again!

00:18:51.174 --> 00:18:52.621
You too!

00:18:53.027 --> 00:18:54.438
Okay!

00:18:55.437 --> 00:18:56.867
Farewell!

00:18:58.242 --> 00:18:59.704
Farewell!

00:19:05.664 --> 00:19:07.651
She is such a gentle teacher.

00:19:08.643 --> 00:19:10.955
She is almost like my mama.

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:13.672
You're a bit too tomboyish
to be her daughter...

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.634
Candy, did something happen to Anthony?

00:19:19.125 --> 00:19:20.395
To Anthony?

00:19:21.311 --> 00:19:24.236
He was acting weird since yesterday.

00:19:24.682 --> 00:19:26.043
My hands.

00:19:26.092 --> 00:19:27.568
Hands?

00:19:40.743 --> 00:19:45.132
My hands. Anthony was startled
when he saw these hands.

00:19:45.768 --> 00:19:47.850
Hey, Candy!

00:19:48.012 --> 00:19:49.377
Anthony!

00:19:51.259 --> 00:19:52.829
I'm sorry for yesterday.

00:19:53.538 --> 00:19:54.023
Huh?

00:19:54.488 --> 00:19:57.461
Allowing you to carry
such heavy bags...

00:19:57.608 --> 00:20:02.136
I haven't realized they're
making you do this all the time.

00:20:02.703 --> 00:20:03.893
Here.

00:20:04.720 --> 00:20:06.367
It's from my own garden.

00:20:06.773 --> 00:20:10.547
I'll give you a much prettier
rose for your birthday.

00:20:12.507 --> 00:20:16.457
Thank you...
But my real birthday...

00:20:16.553 --> 00:20:20.075
Alright! Next time we meet,
let's make it your birthday.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:21.600
Anthony!

00:20:42.884 --> 00:20:46.426
Okay? Next time we meet,
it's your birthday.

00:21:00.142 --> 00:21:06.873
Candy's spirit was full of happiness,
almost as if a rose were blooming in her heart.

00:21:07.341 --> 00:21:14.030
She thought; this emotion must be
the hapiness sister Lane told her about.

00:21:15.429 --> 00:21:20.000
To be continued...
